The Quest is a role-playing game with an emphasis on strategy. The game is turn-based, so take your time 
choosing your tactics. In the course of the journey, you will face many fierce monsters and will interact with different people that will aid or hinder you in your quest. The game is very challenging, and you will have to make use of different strategies 
if you hope to succeed. It is very important to read this manual completely, since it will only take you a few minutes and save you a serious headache in the future.
