6e00650074000000}}}{\fldrslt {\cs18\fs24\ul\cf2 kutsenok@mixi.net}}}{\fs24  and I will send you the file you need.
\par 
\par Q.  I have a problem and it is not one of the above.
\par A.  Send me an e-mail and I will be glad to help you. 
